Hindi ako makakasama mo sa paggawa ng hadlang.

260
00:14:18.566 --> 00:14:22.653
Hindi ako maaaring pumunta at bumuo ng hadlang sa iyo.

261
00:14:29.451 --> 00:14:30.286
Dong-myeong.

262
00:14:33.038 --> 00:14:33.998
Hindi niya kaya.

263
00:14:36.667 --> 00:14:37.793
Dong-myeong.

264
00:14:40.754 --> 00:14:41.672
Dong-myeong.

265
00:14:44.341 --> 00:14:45.301
Dong-myeong.

266
00:14:47.928 --> 00:14:49.221
papunta na ako.

267
00:14:51.390 --> 00:14:52.308
Dong-myeong.

268
00:14:53.893 --> 00:14:54.810
Dong-myeong.

269
00:14:55.311 --> 00:14:57.021
<i>Patuloy na tinatawag ni Tatay ang kanyang pangalan.</i>

270
00:14:57.104 --> 00:14:58.480
Dong-myeong.

271
00:15:00.274 --> 00:15:04.653
<i>Ang pangalan na wala sa kanya</i>
<i>nasabi ko nang napakatagal.</i>

272
00:15:05.237 --> 00:15:07.114
Dong. Dong.

273
00:15:07.197 --> 00:15:08.282
Dong-myeong.

274
00:15:14.079 --> 00:15:15.456
Dong-myeong.

275
00:15:15.539 --> 00:15:17.458
<i>Sa wakas nakita na ni Nanay</i>

276
00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:21.337
<i>Ang panloob na bilangguan ni Tatay sa unang pagkakataon.</i>

277
00:15:26.008 --> 00:15:26.926
<i>Harang?</i>

278
00:15:27.009 --> 00:15:28.427
ENDOSCOPY CENTER

279
00:15:28.510 --> 00:15:29.678
Oo, sabi niya,

280
00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:31.680
"Dapat hindi na ako pumunta

281
00:15:33.349 --> 00:15:35.017
