286
00:15:49.657 --> 00:15:51.367
tungkol sa nawawala naming anak.

287
00:15:55.454 --> 00:15:57.998
Well, tinanong ko siya na sabihin sa akin
noong ako ay nasa ilalim,

288
00:15:58.082 --> 00:16:01.001
pero bago ko pa nalaman,
tapos na daw ako.

289
00:16:02.795 --> 00:16:04.713
Tatay, gusto mo bang kumain?

290
00:16:04.797 --> 00:16:05.923
Kukunin kita kahit ano.

291
00:16:06.423 --> 00:16:08.300
- Tiyan ng baboy?
- Tiyan ng baboy?

292
00:16:08.384 --> 00:16:09.927
Oo.

293
00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:11.637
<i>Sa kanilang puso</i>...

294
00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:16.433
